# ROTATOR CUFF TRAINING

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

Rotator Cuff Training consists of targeted exercises designed to improve shoulder stability, dynamic joint control and long-term resilience.

Within CAS, it is considered a foundational robustness intervention for maintaining shoulder health in combat athletes.

---

# Philosophy

A powerful shoulder is not necessarily a healthy shoulder.

Combat athletes perform thousands of explosive upper-body actions every month.

The rotator cuff maintains glenohumeral stability throughout these movements.

CAS develops rotator cuff capacity to preserve performance over years rather than weeks.

